<title>USA: FGIC qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Thursday it qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Regional School District No 10, Conn., $4.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Methuen, Mass., $27.96 million municipal purpose loan.</p>
<p>--Stafford Township, N.J., $8.28 million improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
